OL,3,GNEWSAPlans unveiled to modernise
OL,4,A100-year-old museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been unveiled to modernise a
OL,7,FGrade II listed Leeds museum that was
OL,8,Fpreviously at risk of closure.
OL,10,FAbbey House Museum in Kirkstall was put
OL,11,Fforward for closure during the city
OL,12,Fcouncil's budget proposals in 2024 -
OL,13,Fbut was saved after a "passionate"
OL,14,Fresponse to a public consultation.
OL,16,FPlans for the museum, which opened in
OL,17,F1927, include upgrades to its replica
OL,18,FVictorian streets to include hands-on
OL,19,Fimmersive experiences, and new
OL,20,Fexhibition spaces.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
